OL,3,CIsle of Man rider dies following
OL,4,Cincident at Manx Grand Prix
OL,6,FA second competitor has died following
OL,7,Fan incident during qualifying for the
OL,8,FManx Grand Prix Races.
OL,10,FLocal motorcyclist Sam Naughton, 37,
OL,11,Ffrom Castletown in the Isle of Man,
OL,12,Fdied during an incident at Doran's
OL,13,FBend, during the third qualifying
OL,14,Fsession of the event.
OL,16,FSam made his debut in 2025, and was in
OL,17,Fhis second year of competing at the
OL,18,FManx Grand Prix.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
