OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787681944
OL,3,CIsle of Man rider dies following
OL,4,Cincident at Manx Grand Prix
OL,6,FOrganisers say he was a regular
OL,7,Fcompetitor at a number of other road
OL,8,Fracing events since he started racing
OL,9,Fin 2020.
OL,11,FIn a statement, organisers said they
OL,12,F"pass on their deepest sympathy to his
OL,13,Fwife Charlotte, his children Bonnie,
OL,14,FLiam, Jesse and Parker, his family,
OL,15,Fand friends."
OL,17,FSam is the second rider to have died
OL,18,Fduring this year's Manx Grand Prix.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
