OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1787681944
OL,3,CIsle of Man rider dies following
OL,4,Cincident at Manx Grand Prix
OL,6,FHis death follows the fatal crash at
OL,7,FCruickshanks, Ramsey, on the opening
OL,8,Flap of the event's second qualifying
OL,9,Fsession on Tuesday, 18 August.
OL,11,FTwo competitors were involved in the
OL,12,Fincident, which led to the session
OL,13,Fbeing red flagged immediately at
OL,14,Faround 6:50pm.
OL,16,FIt was later confirmed that one
OL,17,Fcompetitor, Mauro Poncini, sustained
OL,18,Ffatal injuries.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
